The Jacksonville FL area is currently not serviced by the American Red Cross Blood Services. &nbsp;Our traditional American Red Cross Humanitarian Services,however are available in Jacksonville FL, just not our blood collections program.<br />
<br />
For a blood bank in your area you can reach out to One Blood, at www.oneblood.org or by calling 1-888-936-6283.<br />
